":"宋"}},{"title":"阆州东园十咏 其六 明月台","author":"文同","text":"微棱生海角，圆魄到天心。\n共上唯佳客，无容照俗襟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6612,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阆州东园十咏 其四 柳桥","author":"文同","text":"挼风誇晚态，垂雨怯春寒。\n为问题芳意，同谁倚画栏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6613,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阆州东园十咏 其九 药栏","author":"文同","text":"玉笋齐抽日，金釭竞列时。\n自然俱可爱，莫放画帘垂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6614,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阆州东园十咏 其二 清风台","author":"文同","text":"无时来见袭，有地更临高。\n坐客清谈起，纷纷落麈毛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6615,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阆州东园十咏 其一 锦屏阁","author":"文同","text":"茂林斑若锦，秀巘矗如屏。\n底处供登览，阑干在杳冥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6616,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"文同","text":"僻陋为州耻不才，偃然空见两星回。\n祇应归举谣言日，三府诸君口尽枚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":6617,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]